{"seq":3,"slug":"empirical-method","title":"Empirical Method","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/ideas-and-methods/empirical-method","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observation-and-experience","title":"观察与经验","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/ideas-and-methods/empirical-method/observation-and-experience","wordCount":1547,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"potentiality-and-actuality","title":"潜能与现实","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/ideas-and-methods/empirical-method/potentiality-and-actuality","wordCount":1214,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现亚里士多德注重经验的方法。与柏拉图重思辨不同，亚里士多德高度重视对具体事物的观察与经验，主张知识应从经验出发、经验与理性相结合——这使他成为西方经验科学传统的重要先驱。他还以\"潜能与现实\"这对核心概念，深刻地解释了\"变化\"——一切变化都是从潜能到现实的实现过程。本章揭示亚里士多德的科学方法与自然哲学。\n"}